#!/bin/bash
set -euo pipefail

cat >&2 <<'EOF'
Automated failback is intentionally disabled.

After ck-db-replica has been promoted, host MySQL is stale. Pointing HAProxy
back to it can lose or fork production writes. Rejoin it by taking a fresh
seed from the active database, rebuilding host MySQL as a read-only replica,
waiting for GTID catch-up, and then performing a second controlled switchover.

Follow:
  /home/ubuntu/compass-kids/ops/mysql-replica/PROMOTION.md

This guard exits without changing services, databases, or HAProxy.
EOF

exit 2
